BT /F1 12 Tf 16 TL 50 740 Td (DocMind: technical overview) Tj T* () Tj T* (DocMind lets you ask questions about a PDF and get answers with page citations.) Tj T* (It is built with a NestJS API and a React front end.) Tj T* () Tj T* (How uploads work) Tj T* (When you upload a PDF, the server extracts the text of every page and splits it into) Tj T* (overlapping chunks of about one thousand characters. Each chunk is turned into a) Tj T* (vector embedding with 768 dimensions and stored in PostgreSQL using the pgvector extension.) Tj T* (Uploaded documents are deleted automatically after 24 hours.) Tj T* ET
