BT /F1 12 Tf 16 TL 50 740 Td (How questions work) Tj T* () Tj T* (A question is embedded with the same model. The database returns the five closest chunks) Tj T* (using cosine distance, which is the retrieval step of retrieval-augmented generation \(RAG\).) Tj T* (The chunks are placed in a prompt and the language model, Gemini, writes an answer that) Tj T* (is streamed back to the browser token by token using Server-Sent Events.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Limits and safety) Tj T* (Each visitor can keep three documents of up to 60 pages. Requests are rate limited and a) Tj T* (global daily cap protects the free-tier AI quota. If the answer is not in the document,) Tj T* (the assistant says so instead of guessing.) Tj T* ET
